  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Estrategia de desarrollo sociocultural, ecol&#xf3;gico, econ&#xf3;mico y estudios de pre inversi&#xf3;n orientados al transporte ferroviario en M&#xe9;xico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective is to: contribute to the creation of a public policy for the development of the Mexican Rail System as an efficient and sustainable transport alternative. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The specific objectives (outcomes) of this contract are: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1. Developing the Socio-Cultural, Ecological and Economic Development Strategy for Rail Transport in Mexico&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2. Pre-investment studies for two pilot projects. The first on the Naucalpan &#xbf; Buenavista Electric Light Train and the second on a similar scope, the details of which have yet to be determined.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
